[statement]
A package whose `install_if` condition the installed packages complete is
installed with any request, though it was not before.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:docs
V:1

P:a-doc
V:1
i:a docs

P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:a
V:1

P:docs
V:1

[world]
a
docs

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install b 1
install a-doc 1
